// has ticked for this deploy environment yet: whoever can edit the connection ticks it there.
// Never in a personal account environment, which has no deploy environments to tick
// (ONPLO-4312). `missing_secret`: a secret the
// flow names does not exist here. `unfilled_variable`: a variable has no value here.
// `agent_without_seat`: an AI step is set to build premium on its own and its agent holds
// no seat. `table_missing`, `table_not_readable`: a table the flow uses is gone, or the
// deploy may not read it. `column_deleted`: a step reads a column that was deleted.
// `invalid_step`: a step is not valid as it stands.
type DeployBlockerKind string

