// SimulateFlowWithBody Test a flow, or one step of it
//
// "TEST THIS STEP" AND SIMULATING A WHOLE FLOW ARE ONE WALK. It starts at the flow's trigger,
// from the example the trigger keeps, and goes step by step. Name a step in
// `stop_after_step_id` and it stops once that step is done; name none and it walks to the end.
//
