// `not_in_plan` and no run is made. The refusal says what is not included, in
// `not_included`: the feature "Replay past runs", and that Premium includes it. It carries
// no counts: a plan sets no number of replays. THIS PARAGRAPH SAID THE REFUSAL "HAS NO SHAPE
// IN ANY CONTRACT YET" until 2026-10-12, when the shared conventions gave it one.
//
// THE SEAT IS THE ONE ASKING'S (ONPLO-3951, ruled by the spec lane on 5 November 2026): whoever
// asks for the replay holds Flows' Premium seat or is refused, so two people may get different
// answers about one failed run. An agent or a machine holds a seat of its own or is refused. It
// is asked after the run is found to have failed and its deploy environment still takes runs,
// and before anything is told or written. When Account cannot be asked, it is refused 503 with
// `account_unavailable`, no run is made, and the same request can be sent again.
