	// `flows:project.change`, is asked of the project. Renaming the folder, `storage:own-folder.change`,
	// is asked of the folder, as the Storage app's own rename asks it. A refusal is one 403.
	//
	// ONLY A PROJECT MADE IN A FOLDER OF YOUR OWN IS RENAMED HERE. A project in System → Flows, a
	// colleague's and an id no project of yours has are not found. A MACHINE IS REFUSED with a 422 on
