	// THE WHOLE LIST, EVERY TIME. Send every category `getFlowsEventPreferences` answers, each
	// with all three switches. A category Flows does not post under, one sent twice, or one left
	// out is refused with 422 naming the field. Sending the same choices again changes nothing.
	//
	// A REQUIRED EVENT CANNOT BE SILENCED. It keeps `in_app` on and at least one of `email` and
