	//
	// THE COMPANY'S RULE IS NOT SENT. It is not yours to write.
	//
	// ONLY A PERSON HAS EVENT CHOICES. An agent or a machine is refused with 403
	// `ring_requires_person`.
	//
	// NOT GATED, and yours alone: it changes nobody else's choices and no other account
	// environment's.
	//
	// WHEN THE NOTIFICATIONS SERVICE CANNOT BE ASKED the answer is 503
	// `notifications_unavailable`. Nothing changed, and the same request can be sent again.
