// TakeOffDeployListWithResponse Take a member or a team off a deploy environment's list of who may deploy
//
// THEY MAY NO LONGER DEPLOY HERE BY NAME, AT ONCE. A role that holds the permission across
// the whole account environment still reaches this one: that is changed where it was given,
// never here. The place is ended and never deleted, and taking off one already off is not an
// error: nothing left to end is a complete end.
//
// WHAT IS LIVE STAYS LIVE. Taking a place off stops the next deploy, and no page says it takes
