//
// NO FILE OF YOURS IN TRASH BY THAT ID IS ONE ANSWER, `flow_not_found`: a file not in Trash, a
// folder, a colleague's file, one on System Storage, and an id nobody minted.
//
// A PART NOT BUILT, AND SO A 501: a restore asked by an agent or a machine, for the reason
// `deleteFlowInOwnFolder` gives (ONPLO-1209).
//
// ONE CHANGE IS RECORDED, naming the flow, about you, once the Storage app has brought it back.
//
