// nothing smaller. A file over it is refused here, `file_too_large`, and nothing is started.
//
// NOTHING CHANGES UNTIL THE SAVE IS COMPLETED. A save nobody finishes leaves the file as it was
// and costs nothing; start another.
//
// NO FILE OF YOURS BY THAT ID IS ONE ANSWER, `flow_not_found`: a folder, a file in Trash, a
// colleague's file, one on System Storage, and an id nobody minted.
//
// A PART NOT BUILT, AND SO A 501: a save started by an agent or a machine. A save is written
// under the person who did the work, and nothing names that person for an agent or a machine
// yet (ONPLO-1193).
//
// Takes any type of body and a specified content type, and returns a wrapper object for the known response body format(s).
//
// Corresponds with POST /flows-in-own-folders/{flow_id}/saves (the `StartFlowInOwnFolderSave` operationId).
